 ## Usage tracking
 
-With `--track_usage` (CLI or demos), each successful generation is reported to the Black Forest Labs licensing API. This requires `BFL_API_KEY` to be set. The code reports usage for `flux-dev`, `flux-dev-kontext`, `flux-dev-fill`, the Canny and Depth models and LoRAs, and `flux-dev-redux`. Other models, including `flux-schnell`, are not tracked. The code's docstring links to the licensing dashboard at `https://dashboard.bfl.ai/licensing/subscriptions`.
